The key idea is:
            The chatbot should not know the business. 
            The chatbot platform provides capabilities; 
            the specific application provides:
                              - knowledge, 
                              - tools, 
                              - policies 
                              - and configuration.


For Example :
                Generic Chatbot Platform
                          │
                          ├── Banking Bot
                          │      ├── Banking knowledge
                          │      ├── Account API
                          │      ├── Transaction API
                          │      └── Banking policies
                          │
                          ├── Insurance Bot
                          │      ├── Insurance knowledge
                          │      ├── Policy API
                          │      ├── Claim API
                          │      └── Insurance policies
                          │
                          └── HR Bot
                                 ├── HR documents
                                 ├── Leave API
                                 ├── Payroll API
                                 └── HR policies

