How I suggest we learn/build it

      Don't jump directly into code.
      
      We'll build it in 8 stages, from an extremely simple chatbot to a production-grade generic platform.
      
            Stage 1 — Understand the basic chatbot
            Stage 2 - Introduce conversation memory
            Stage 3 - Make it generic
            Stage 4 - Add RAG
            Stage 5 - Tool calling
            Stage 6 - Make integration extremely easy
