Stage 6 — Make integration extremely easy

          This is where your requirement:          
                  "easy to integrate with any system or application"          
          becomes important.
          
          We should support multiple integration mechanisms.
          
          Option 1 — REST API  Any application can call:POST /api/v1/chat
          Option 2 — SDK
                  For Java applications:
                                          ChatbotClient client = new ChatbotClient(...);
                        
                                          ChatResponse response =  client.chat(request);
                  We could eventually create:
                          Java SDK
                          Python SDK
                          Node.js SDK




            Option 3 — Webhook : External systems can receive events:
            Option 4 — Streaming            
                                Instead of:                                
                                            Wait 5 seconds
                                                  ↓
                                            Complete answer
            
                              we support:  Token → Token → Token → Token → ...
                              
                              using: SSE
                              
                                    or potentially WebSockets depending on requirements.

