Stage 8 — Multi-tenant chatbot platform

This is the final level.

Imagine your platform has:
            Customer A → Banking chatbot
            Customer B → Insurance chatbot
            Customer C → Telecom chatbot
            Customer D → HR chatbot


All use the same infrastructure.

We introduce:
              tenantId
              botId
              conversationId
              userId
For example:
            {
              "tenantId": "icici",
              "botId": "banking-assistant",
              "conversationId": "abc123",
              "userId": "user456",
              "message": "Show my last transactions"
            }

Then:             
              Chatbot Platform
                       │
             ┌─────────┼─────────┐
             │         │         │
           Tenant A  Tenant B  Tenant C
             │         │         │
           Bot A     Bot B     Bot C

This is essentially a Chatbot-as-a-Platform / Chatbot-as-a-Service architecture.
This is Dependency Inversion + Strategy pattern + Adapter pattern working together.

That will be especially useful for your L5 interview preparation.
